      "id": "t_000201",
      "topic": "transport",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "zh": "随着经济的快速发展，私家车在中国家庭中越来越普及。",
      "reference": "In China, private cars are becoming increasingly popular among families with the rapid development of the economy.",
