      "hints": [
        "得分点：私家车 / 越来越普及 / 随着……的快速发展 / 经济",
        "「普及」可译 popular；「随着」用 with the development of 引出背景状语",
        "句型：In China, private cars are becoming …, with the rapid development of …."
      ],
      "topicWords": [
        "private cars",
        "public transport",
        "traffic"
      ],
      "source": "authored"
